{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261112/photo/bkn-20261112115457749-1112_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261112134333\"/><p>現場為福佬村道一間銀行。(張開裕攝)</p><p>今晨(12日)10時53分，執法部門接獲九龍城福佬村道18號滙豐銀行的職員報案，指一名女子到來存款，其中5張面額100元的澳元的鈔票(折算約2700港元)有異，懷疑為偽鈔。警員到場調查，檢走有關鈔票，案件詳情有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T06:03:59.115328+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T03:54:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T06:37:55.844584+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T05:57:31.091519+00:00","content_hash":"4249bf1ebb9274f1dcc60d422fa1c4b3c5955986b100b0403be7ca1fb04c499f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}